OL,3,GNEWSATeenager arrested for suspected   
OL,4,Astabbing after crash                   
OL,6,FA teenager has been arrested after the 
OL,7,Fdriver of a car that had crashed into a
OL,8,Fbuilding was found with a suspected    
OL,9,Fstab wound.                            
OL,11,FSussex Police said emergency services  
OL,12,Fwere called to the incident in South   
OL,13,FStreet, Worthing, following reports at 
OL,14,Fabout 20:30 GMT on Wednesday.          
OL,16,FThe driver was treated at the scene by 
OL,17,Fambulance crews and taken to hospital  
OL,18,Fwhere he remains in a serious          
OL,19,Fcondition, the force said.             
